<h1>#{title}
<p>
  The key to building a successful team in Naruto Unison is choosing ninja whose abilities work well together.
<h2>Chakra Generation
<p>
  Almost all skills cost chakra, and more powerful skills typically cost more chakra. These ninja can generate chakra or steal it from the opposing team, making it easier for allies to use their most powerful skills.
<details>
  <summary>
    View ninja
  ^{character "Choji Akimichi" Original}
  ^{character "Inoichi Yamanaka" Original}
