  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sai" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Shino Aburame" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tsunade" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Zetsu" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Reanimated}
<h2>Cooldown Reduction
<p>
  Cooldown reduction is a rare ability that shortens the active cooldowns of instant skills, meaning they can be used more often. These ninja can reduce or reset the cooldowns of their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Hashirama Senju" Reanimated}
<h2>Countering
<p>
  To counter a skill means to negate its effects, and optionally retaliate against its user. These ninja can protect their team from skills by applying countering effects to allies or enemies.
