<h2>Damage Reduction
<p>
  Damage reduction is a status effect that decreases the amount of damage taken from direct enemy attacks. Piercing and affliction damage are unaffected by damage reduction. These ninja can protect their team by applying damage reduction to their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Aoba Yamashiro" Original}
  ^{character "Asuma Sarutobi" Original}
  ^{character "Choji Akimichi" Original}
  ^{character "Hiruzen Sarutobi" Original}
  ^{character "Misumi Tsurugi" Original}
  ^{character "Animal Path Pain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Dodai" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Kankuro" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Konan of the Rain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Onoki" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Temari" Shippuden}
<h2>Death Denial
<p>
  Normally, once a ninja's health reaches zero, they die and cannot be used for the rest of the match. These ninja can prevent that from happening, either by protecting an ally from dying or by resurrecting them after death.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Aoba Yamashiro" Original}
  ^{character "Hiruzen Sarutobi" Original}
  ^{character "Chiyo" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Ittan" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Konohamaru Sarutobi" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Temari" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tsunade" Shippuden}
<h2>Destructible Barrier
<p>
  Destructible barrier is the opposite of destructible defense. When the target attempts to damage others, their destructible barrier takes damage instead. These ninja can protect their team from damage by applying destructible barrier to enemies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Deva Path Pain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Yamato" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Reanimated}
  ^{character "Rasa" Reanimated}
<h2>Destructible Defense
<p>
  Destructible defense is the opposite of destructible barrier. It appends to the target's health bar and takes damage instead of the target. These ninja can protect their team from damage by applying destructible defense to their allies.
<details>
