<h2>Redirection
<p>
  Redirection is a rare status effect that causes the effects of harmful skills to be redirected to other targets. These ninja can protect their team from skills by applying redirection to their allies.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Asuma Sarutobi" Original}
  ^{character "Hiashi Hyuga" Original}
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Original}
  ^{character "Misumi Tsurugi" Original}
