  ^{character "Sasori" Reanimated}
<h2>Sensing
<p>
  Sensing is a rare status effect that reveals invisible effects and skill cooldowns of enemy ninja. These ninja can apply sensing to their enemies, making it easier to strategize against them and avoid triggering traps.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Fu Yamanaka" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Human Path Pain" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Ino Yamanaka" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Nagato" Reanimated}
<h2>Status Curing
<p>
  Certain status effects can be removed by skills. These ninja can support their team by removing harmful status effects from them.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Rin Nohara" Original}
  ^{character "Shizune" Original}
  ^{character "Chiyo" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Kabuto Yakushi" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Kakashi Hatake" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sage Mode Kabuto" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Sakura Haruno" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Tobi" Shippuden}
<h2>Status Prevention
<p>
  Status prevention is a rare status effect that blocks other effects, either by disabling active effects or by preventing new status effects from being applied to the target. These ninja can protect their team from negative status effects.
<details>
  <summary>View ninja
  ^{character "Baki" Original}
  ^{character "Haku" Original}
  ^{character "Dodai" Shippuden}
  ^{character "Ino Yamanaka" Shippuden}
